t":"S_N=1-2^{-N}","end":17,"kind":"math","start":3},{"content":" 及剩余面积 ","end":24,"kind":"text","start":17},{"content":"2^{-N}","end":32,"kind":"math","start":24},{"content":"，不声称有限帧已画出无限多个矩形。","end":49,"kind":"text","start":32}],"source_index":5},{"fragments":[{"content":"由等比级数极限得总面积为 ","end":13,"kind":"text","start":0},{"content":"1","end":16,"kind":"math","start":13},{"content":"；说明这是具名分割的可列可加例子。","end":33,"kind":"text","start":16}],"source_index":6},{"fragments":[{"content":"D=R_0\\sqcup\\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty}R_k","end":38,"kind":"math","start":0},{"content":"，","end":39,"kind":"text","start":38},{"content":"S_N=1-2^{-N}","end":53,"kind":"math","start":39},{"content":"，总面积 ","end":58,"kind":"text","start":53},{"content":"0+\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}2^{-k}=1","end":89,"kind":"math","start":58},{"content":"。","end":90,"kind":"text","start":89}],"source_index":7}],"schema":"text-fragment-plan-v2","source_sha256":"3ab835da9e4a0fc976293a0b3ed2ff300009d2e30bcec18b2786ff890b09efa0","sources":["用单位正方形 $D=[0,1]^2$ 的可列分割直观说明面积的可列可加性，并明确小矩形边界的归属。","绘制 $D$，明确左边界单独记为零面积集合 $R_0$。","画出 $R_1=(\\frac{1}{2},1]\\times[0,1]$，标面积 $\\frac{1}{2}$；端点归属按定义处理。","画出 $R_2=(\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{1}{2}]\\times[0,1]$，标面积 $\\frac{1}{4}$，与 $R_1$ 不重叠。","继续示意有限多个 $R_k$，显示一般边界 $2^{-k}$，不把共用描边误认为集合相交。","显示 $S_N=1-2^{-N}$ 及剩余面积 $2^{-N}$，不声称有限帧已画出无限多个矩形。","由等比级数极限得总面积为 $1$；说明这是具名分割的可列可加例子。","$D=R_0\\sqcup\\bigcup_{k=1}^{\\infty}R_k$，$S_N=1-2^{-N}$，总面积 $0+\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}2^{-k}=1$。"]}